.TH std::mdspan::static_extent 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::mdspan::static_extent \- std::mdspan::static_extent

.SH Synopsis
static constexpr std::size_t static_extent( rank_type r ) noexcept;  (since C++23)

Statically determines the extent of a mdspan at the rank index r. If the rank index r
corresponds to a dynamic extent, returns std::dynamic_extent. Equivalent to return
Extents::static_extent(r);.

.SH Parameters

r - The rank index to get the static extent size of

.SH Return value

The static extent size, or std::dynamic_extent.

